{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/5963ed74b966cb541bd16aa7ed1f4907.poster.avif?t=1760643701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/5963ed74b966cb541bd16aa7ed1f4907.webm?t=1760643701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your great aunt Alison has left you her old manor house. You have always dreamt of creating your own dinosaur museum and now you finally have the space to do it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for fossils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your exhibits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your museum to visitors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend quirky characters from the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up your manor to create (and redecorate!) a museum where everyone feels welcome!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/9fbb60b018fbf807babc42e19b81856b.poster.avif?t=1760643701\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/9fbb60b018fbf807babc42e19b81856b.webm?t=1760643701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fossil Quest is in its <strong>early stages of development</strong>. We currently have a public, free prototype on Itch where you can play and 